%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: register_deployment()<br/>(MAC + GPU reserved atomically)
    Pending --> DeployingNetworks
    DeployingNetworks --> CloningStorage
    CloningStorage --> DefiningVMs
    DefiningVMs --> Validating
    Validating --> Running: acceptance criteria pass

    DeployingNetworks --> Error: any step fails
    CloningStorage --> Error: any step fails
    DefiningVMs --> Error: any step fails
    Validating --> Error: acceptance criteria fail

    Error --> RollingBack: automatic
    RollingBack --> RolledBack: cleanup succeeded<br/>(frees MAC prefix + GPU)
    RollingBack --> Error: cleanup itself failed<br/>(resources stay reserved)

    Running --> Destroying: DELETE /missions/id
    Destroying --> Destroyed: frees MAC prefix + GPU

    RolledBack --> [*]
    Destroyed --> [*]
